Median optimization diagnostics across 150 designs per condition, pooling five targets. The ipTM proxy summarizes interface confidence from the distogram, which the model learns to predict during training. Sequence entropy is the mean per-residue entropy of the soft amino acid probabilities. The dashed line marks the uniform maximum over 19 amino acids (cysteine probability is initialized to 0).
:::


Steering redirected structural predictions before optimization strongly favored particular amino acids. The early soft-sequence stage therefore offers a point of control over the structures that emerge. This sensitivity also suggests that small changes to the starting amino acid probabilities could influence design outcomes.

